E AX2004 1102-alloc-removed.ax:8:14-19 removed-construct "`alloc` is no longer part of Axiom" #"`alloc` was refused rather than implemented: the form typed as a pointer and evaluated to the constant 0, so a program holding one held no memory" ?"allocate with `__alloc`, or use `vecNew`, `strAlloc` or a struct: `(alloc T n)` typed `*mut T` and evaluated to 0, so it never allocated anything"
